  "priorExpiration": "2020-03-31",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2902.05 “Drug Monitoring Initiative (DMI)” means the monthly unclassified publication from the New Hampshire Information and Analysis Center (IAC) reporting on the data trends of narcotics and available at http://www.dhhs.nh.gov/dcbcs/bdas/data.htm or by signing up for distribution through the IAC.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2900) #11150, eff 8-5-16, EXEMPT; ss by #12227, EXEMPT, eff 6-29-17 (from Saf-C 2902.03); ss by #12527, eff 5-11-18; ss by #12894, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 10-3-19, EXPIRED: 3-31-20\n\nNew. #13230, eff 7-9-21",
